ation":["아직"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不会做动词所指的动作。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"f843025cff483034","term":"읽다","zh":"阅读","audio":"/audio/f843025cff483034e05a.mp3","entryId":"68752","definition":"看文字了解其意思。","pronunciation":["익따"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"67efdcce600d3df4","term":"결말","zh":"结局，结尾","audio":"/audio/67efdcce600d3df489fb.mp3","entryId":"30289","definition":"某件事或某个故事的最后。","pronunciation":["결말"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"出现，达成","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"显现某事的效果或结果等。","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"8aa230c6a19b7e60","term":"궁금하다","zh":"好奇，纳闷儿","audio":"/audio/8aa230c6a19b7e60293f.mp3","entryId":"35136","definition":"非常想知道。","pronunciation":["궁금하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b381290e648f1e59b817.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.396,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=30289","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":162,"sequenceScore":3.2227,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这部小说真的很有意思，对吧？","嗯，虽然还没读完，但很好奇结局会是怎么样。","像这样没事可做，只能等地铁的时间实在太无聊了。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这部小说真的很有意思，对吧？","嗯，虽然还没读完，但很好奇结局会是怎么样。","像这样没事可做，只能等地铁的时间实在太无聊了。"],"answer":1}]}
